   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN OBJECTIVE OF ZANGOF IS TO RECOGNISE THE CONTRIBUTION OF NGOS TO THE DEVELOPMENT PROCESSES IN ZANZIBAR, AND PROMOTE DIALOGUE BETWEEN THESE STA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Annual Zanzibar NGOs Forum is a platform that brings together government, NGOs and other government stakeholders, to reflect on the opportunities for enhancing collaboration, and discuss challenges to be resolved. The platform has high-level sanction within the government of Zanzibar, and significant buy in from the non-profit sector.</narrative>
